# Everything in this repo is text and is stored with LF.
#
# Without this line, a checkout on Windows writes CRLF into the working tree and
# every one of the 276 files reads as modified with no content change in any of
# them: 3,927,051 lines inserted, 3,927,051 deleted, all of it \r. That happened
# on 2026-09-11 and it hid the real diff until 2026-09-14.
#
# eol=lf, not just text=auto, because serve.sh has to stay executable as a shell
# script and the tools/*.py all run under python3 on whatever machine opens them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything git's own heuristic might get wrong, said out loud.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
